![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The code snippet uses accountId without showing how it is obtained. For consistency with the "Stack Configuration" section and other snippets in this guide, it should be retrieved from the Pulumi configuration. This also helps users avoid hardcoding sensitive or environment-specific values, providing a technical safeguard against configuration errors.

```suggestion
const config = new pulumi.Config();
const accountId = config.require("cloudflare:accountId");

const prodDb = new cloudflare.D1Database("prod-db", {accountId, name: "production-database"},
    {protect: true});
```

